I have always thought that those scrolls were failed teleport traps.
For example:

   -------
   |.....|
   -.....|
   |.....|
   --+----
     ?
      ########
      #
      #
 
The "?" appears as a scroll of teleport rather than a ^ of teleport
(ad arerium) because it is accessable from the hallway.

At any rate, if you ever find a scroll in the middle of a hallway,
you can be pretty sure that it's a scroll of teleportation.

